# The list of vouched and denounced users for this repository.
#
# Only vouched users may open pull requests against Vesper. A denounced user is
# explicitly blocked from contributing.
#
# Syntax:
#  - One handle per line (without @). Sorted alphabetically.
#  - To denounce a user, prefix with minus: `-username` or `-platform:username`.
#  - Optionally, add details after a space following the handle.
#
# Admins can vouch for new contributors by commenting "!vouch" on a discussion
# in the "Vouch Request" category. Admins can denounce users by commenting
# "!denounce" or "!denounce [username]" on a discussion, issue, or pull request,
# and can remove a user entirely with "!unvouch".
#
# This file is committed directly to `main` by the vouch workflows, using a
# GitHub App that is a bypass actor on the "Protect Main" ruleset. You can also
# edit it by hand through a normal pull request.
#
# See CONTRIBUTING.md and https://github.com/mitchellh/vouch for details.
simonsteer
